<title>USA: Fujitisu, NetSpeak in development pact.</title>
<headline>Fujitisu, NetSpeak in development pact.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-07-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fujitsu Business Communication Systems, a unit of Fujitsu Ltd, and NetSpeak Corp said Monday they had signed a joint development and original equipment manufactuers agreement.</p>
<p>NetSpeak will supply its Internet Protocol-based telephony and call center technologies to Fujitsu.</p>
<p>Also, the companies agreed to develop enhancements to each other's products to deliver new features and functions.</p>
<p>Financial terms of the deal were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
